aced within the curriculum based on the Diploma Policy (DP) and Curriculum Policy (CP) established by each faculty and graduate school. By studying these courses with the DP and CP in mind, you will develop the abilities expected by each faculty and graduate school. The DP, CP, and curriculum schedule (course list, etc.) for each faculty and graduate school are available at the link below; please use them as a reference for your study plan. https://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/reference?typeCd=0&amp;cabinetId=557&amp;directLink=1 *This is a link to kwic (accessible only to current students)."], "成績評価Grading0": ["種別　Type備考　Note", "割合　Percentage", "評価基準等　Grading Criteria etc."], "成績評価Grading1": ["その他／Others (99)", "100 %", "Classroom Activities 30%, Presentations 30%, Overall Engagement 10%, Individual Assignments - Homework/Quizzes/Journal 30%"], "成績評価Grading2": ["備考　Note Grade assessment may be subject to revisions according to student needs and abilities at the teacher's discretion------------------------Please refer to the following URL for details regarding the attendance and tardiness policy.https://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/area/detail?areaId=7144&amp;directLink=1------------------------"], "備考Note0": ["If students are late to class, they are considered tardy. If more than 30 minutes late, they are considered absent. Two instances of tardiness are counted as one absence. One point per tardiness and two points per absence is taken off the final grade. A combination of 4 absences / 8 tardiness will result in a failing grade and the students expulsion from the class."], "備考Note1": ["L&amp;S Needs Analysis.png", "Student Needs Analysis Survey"], "備考Note2": ["Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 10.40.47.png", "Google Classroom Course Code"], "備考Note3": ["2026年09月25日 20時32分26秒"], "項番No.0": [], "項番No.1": ["2026年度", "秋学期／Fall", "月曜４時限／Monday 4", "秋学期／Fall", "４別－３０２"], "項番No.2": ["2026年度", "秋学期／Fall", "金曜５時限／Friday 5", "秋学期／Fall", "ＭＲ－２０３"]}, "campas": 0, "name": "【250】Skills-based